OL,3,GNEWSACouncil raise no objection to
OL,4,Amajor hydro scheme near Loch Ness
OL,5,
OL,6,FHighland Council is to raise no
OL,7,Fobjection to a major hydro-electric
OL,8,Fproject near Loch Ness - on the
OL,9,Fcondition there are strict rules on
OL,10,Frock blasting and the colour of a dam
OL,11,Fwall.
OL,13,FUnder the proposals, Glen Earrach
OL,14,FPumped Storage Hydro scheme would use
OL,15,FLoch nam Breac Dearga, in hills above
OL,16,FDrumnadrochit, as an upper reservoir
OL,17,Fand Loch Ness as a lower one.
OL,19,FIn a vote, Highland Council's south
OL,20,Fplanning applications committee was
OL,21,Fsplit on whether to support or oppose
OL,22,Fthe plans.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
