OL,3,GNEWSACouncil raise no objection to
OL,4,Amajor hydro scheme near Loch Ness
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommittee chairman Paul Oldham used his
OL,7,Fcasting vote to back an amendment to
OL,8,Fraise no objection, provided blasting
OL,9,Ftook place in daytime and the dam wall
OL,10,Fwas blended in with surrounding hills.
